Z||000002||1FST2M6||01-30-2001||12:02 PM||||not american.. only the dodge sticker is american.. and it's even made in mexico.. the 3000GT VR4 and it are the same car minus badging and seat stiching. vicsus LSD, some (93-94) have the "AERO" package where-in the rear wing moved at speed and under braking. they are killer cars launch like hell and ride like a dream.. but don't waste your time trying to get it to corner... it's to heavey and you'll just plow into the tire wall. aroun .9g is all you'll be able to see and still be able to drive it with out a kidney belt. 1.6 60' times are easy to attain and high 12 in the 1/4 are $420 away with a Greddy Profec B managing the boost properly. go fast goodies are EVERYWHERE and they are easy to get fix-it part for too...  ||||reg||1
Z||000003||ferg||01-30-2001||01:48 PM||||pro- fast<BR>con- paying for insurance ||||reg||1
