Z||000011||Joe4x4||01-31-2001||02:51 AM||||Yes I do have 3 fieros,2 fords, sold my show truck.and 2 motorcycles and yes they are rice.<P>I saw a dodge stealth 92 on e-bay it sold for $7,800 ,was gonna bid on it ....I was asleep , was gonna bid at the last 10 min.<BR> <BR>It looked nice twin turbo awd aws with a fresh rebuilt motor 12 miles on it.<BR> <BR>OK yes it is not AMERICAN made but so what ?<BR>Do you not have a RICE made VCR or TV ?<P>I`ve got into this AMERICAN made with with <BR>Harley guys . It`s BU!! SH!T !!!!!<P>If something is built right WHY KNOCK IT ..<P>Here is some info I found on  the Dodge Stealth....<BR> <A HREF="http://stealth.senecac.on.ca/stealth.html" TARGET=_blank>http://stealth.senecac.on.ca/stealth.html</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Fiero got fire<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/exp.gif">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/animated_cat.gif"> ||||reg||6
Z||000012||p4n1c||01-31-2001||08:35 AM||||I've ridden in and drove a '92 Stealth.  Non-TT.  Faster than hell(5-speed manual), and the guy who owned it would do e-brake turns in the middle of intersections to get where he wanted to go. lol.  But the turning radius on those things blow and they are heavy cars.  Don't try to take fast corners and don't try to do u-turns in it.<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)||||reg||1
